Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:04.11,注释,,0,0,0,,翻译  1440kHz
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:04.11,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(525,345.333)}海绵侦探
Dialogue: 1,0:00:07.17,0:00:08.93,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,﻿问题挥之不去
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.17,0:00:08.93,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The question still persists
Dialogue: 1,0:00:09.21,0:00:10.74,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,为何大家都叫我侦探
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.21,0:00:10.74,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Why do they call me "Gumshoe"?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.21,0:00:10.74,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\fs26.667\pos(476,408.889)}口香糖鞋
Dialogue: 1,0:00:12.98,0:00:14.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,也许这就是原因吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.98,0:00:14.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, maybe this is why
Dialogue: 1,0:00:15.58,0:00:16.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,但它是从哪来的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.58,0:00:16.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But where did it come from?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:18.08,0:00:19.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,而且更重要的是
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.08,0:00:19.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And even more importantly
Dialogue: 1,0:00:19.68,0:00:21.61,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,五秒定律能用吗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.68,0:00:21.61,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,can I exercise the 5-second rule?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:22.62,0:00:23.23,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,有何不可
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.62,0:00:23.23,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Why not?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:25.47,0:00:26.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,又怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.47,0:00:26.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What now?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:27.31,0:00:29.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,走路看路  你这
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.31,0:00:29.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Watch where you're going, you
Dialogue: 1,0:00:29.48,0:00:30.43,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,痞老板吗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.48,0:00:30.43,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Plankton, huh?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:30.43,0:00:30.84,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.43,0:00:30.84,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Wait
Dialogue: 1,0:00:32.03,0:00:34.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,现在大家会叫我海绵痞探吗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.03,0:00:34.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now would they call me "Planktonshoe SquarePants"?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.03,0:00:34.57,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\fs26.667\pos(492,408.88)}痞老板鞋
Dialogue: 1,0:00:34.95,0:00:35.98,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这名字不好听
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.95,0:00:35.98,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I don't like the ring of it
Dialogue: 1,0:00:36.61,0:00:38.53,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,合乎逻辑的选择只有一个
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.61,0:00:38.53,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,There's only one logical option
Dialogue: 1,0:00:46.29,0:00:47.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一桩谜案解开了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.29,0:00:47.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, that was one mystery solved
Dialogue: 1,0:00:47.75,0:00:49.13,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,现在来解开下一桩
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.75,0:00:49.13,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now it was on to the next
Dialogue: 1,0:00:51.28,0:00:52.03,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我在哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.28,0:00:52.03,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Where am I?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:52.76,0:00:56.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵侦探
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.76,0:00:56.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Gumshoe SquarePants
